{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat /candidate/requirements/fixture-requirements.md /evidence/work/rc-step/deck.cir /evidence/work/rc-step/control.sp /evidence/work/rc-step/ngspice.log'","aggregated_output":"# Declared fixture requirements (RC low-pass review exercise)\n\nThese are artificial review requirements declared for this demonstration\nfixture. They are not ECU electrical requirements, and they are fixed for the\nwhole demonstration (recorded before any review run).\n\n1. Step response: with an ideal 1 V step at /IN and no external load, the\n   voltage at /OUT at t = 1 ms after the step must satisfy\n   0.62 V <= V(/OUT, 1 ms) <= 0.65 V.\n   (Intended design: R1 = 10 kohm, C1 = 100 nF, tau = 1 ms,\n   V(1 ms) = 1 - exp(-1) = 0.6321 V.)\n2. Geometry: every copper track segment on the board must be at least\n   0.20 mm wide. This is a declared geometric requirement for the exercise,\n   not an ampacity or manufacturing guarantee.\n\nScope limits: the ideal R/C simulation establishes only the unloaded step\nresponse. Tolerance, temperature, loading, ADC sampling, EMI and hardware\nbehavior are untested by this fixture.\n* agent-ee rc_transient deck, generated from the native XML netlist\nC1 OUT 0 100n\nR1 IN OUT 100k\nVSTEP IN 0 PWL(0 0 1n 1)\n.tran 0.005m 5m\n.meas tran vout_1ms FIND v(OUT) AT=1m\n.meas tran vout_5ms FIND v(OUT) AT=5m\n.end\n* agent-ee generated ngspice control script\n.control\nset num_threads=1\nset noaskquit\nsource /work/deck.cir\nrun\nwrite /work/result.raw\nquit\n.endc\n.end\n\nNote: No compatibility mode selected!\n\n\nCircuit: * agent-ee generated ngspice control script\n\n\nNote: No compatibility mode selected!\n\n\nCircuit: * agent-ee rc_transient deck, generated from the native xml netlist\n\nDoing analysis at TEMP = 27.000000 and TNOM = 27.000000\n\nUsing SPARSE 1.3 as Direct Linear Solver\n\nInitial Transient Solution\n--------------------------\n\nNode                                   Voltage\n----                                   -------\nout                                          0\nin                                           0\nvstep#branch                                 0\n\n\nNo. of Data Rows : 1025\n\n  Measurements for Transient Analysis\n\nvout_1ms            =  9.516251e-02\nvout_5ms            =  3.934693e-01\n\nbinary raw file \"/work/result.raw\"\nngspice-42 done\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
